WEBVTT

00:19.130 --> 00:22.830
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:23.110 --> 00:28.340
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.510 --> 00:34.040
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:34.220 --> 00:39.380
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.560 --> 00:44.820
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:45.130 --> 00:50.570
<i>Will you ever know how I feel?</i>
<i>Will you know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:50.770 --> 00:56.210
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.370 --> 01:01.640
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:01.840 --> 01:09.550
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:26.000 --> 01:27.870
Hello, Shirokin High School...

01:28.340 --> 01:30.430
Uh, yes, it is, actually...

01:30.740 --> 01:32.440
Huh? Oh, all right...

01:32.580 --> 01:34.200
One moment, please.

01:34.680 --> 01:36.340
Ms. Yamaguchi, you have a call.

01:36.450 --> 01:37.780
Oh, thank you.

01:38.010 --> 01:41.920
Um, he says he's calling from your
home, but he's a little strange...

01:42.020 --> 01:42.710
Huh?

01:42.820 --> 01:46.280
"Lady, gotta talk to Yamaguchi,
put her on, willya?"

01:47.220 --> 01:48.850
Could be a crank call...

01:53.530 --> 01:54.620
Hello?

01:54.730 --> 01:56.290
Ojou? It's me, Minoru.

01:56.400 --> 01:58.590
Oh, hello, Minoru...

01:58.700 --> 02:00.140
I've got bad news, Ojou!

02:00.240 --> 02:03.210
You idiot, I told you
never to call me at school!

02:03.340 --> 02:06.100
Yeah, but you forgot your cell phone...

02:06.910 --> 02:08.500
Anyway, here's the news.

02:08.640 --> 02:09.540
Kumicho!

02:09.650 --> 02:10.440
Kumicho!

02:10.550 --> 02:13.520
They took the Kumicho
away in an ambulance!

02:15.050 --> 02:20.010
<i>OOEDO CLAN IN CRISIS!</i>

02:24.630 --> 02:25.420
Kumiko!

02:26.160 --> 02:27.320
Consigliere!

02:27.430 --> 02:28.290
Grandpa...

02:28.400 --> 02:29.920
They said that Grandpa collapsed!

02:30.670 --> 02:32.230
I'm sure he'll be fine.

02:32.370 --> 02:33.800
Come on, you have to be strong.

02:33.900 --> 02:34.930
Consigliere...

02:35.440 --> 02:36.430
Uh, Ojou.

02:36.640 --> 02:37.700
Consigliere.

02:37.810 --> 02:39.070
How's the Kumicho doing?

02:39.170 --> 02:42.370
Well, he hasn't been taking it
easy like he should have been.

02:42.480 --> 02:45.940
But he'll be all right if
he stays here for a few weeks.

02:46.350 --> 02:47.110
I see.

02:47.550 --> 02:48.680
That's good news.

02:49.690 --> 02:52.090
Ojou, there's nothing to worry about.

02:53.120 --> 02:55.590
Ojou, did you hear me?

02:56.190 --> 02:58.180
You don't have to worry.

02:58.490 --> 02:59.430
Ojou?

02:59.860 --> 03:03.360
Wakamatsu!
Can't I have this moment?

03:04.430 --> 03:07.060
Kumiko, forgive me for
causing all this trouble.

03:07.170 --> 03:08.260
Don't say that.

03:08.370 --> 03:11.640
I'm leaving the Ooedo Clan,
This Thing of Ours, in your hands.

03:12.070 --> 03:13.240
Don't worry about it.

03:13.340 --> 03:15.370
Just get well, Grandpa!

03:15.940 --> 03:20.410
Well, the thing is, I've been hearing
some dubious rumors lately...

03:20.550 --> 03:22.880
You watch your back. Got that?

03:23.690 --> 03:24.620
Got it!

03:25.920 --> 03:29.690
Man, I'm so glad the
Kumicho's gonna be all right.

03:29.890 --> 03:31.990
Ojou was relieved, too.

03:32.090 --> 03:33.860
Cheers! Cheers!

03:37.370 --> 03:38.930
I know it's a relief, but...

03:39.030 --> 03:40.630
...you really shouldn't drink so much.

03:39.600 --> 03:40.630
Hit me again!

03:40.770 --> 03:42.070
Cheers!

03:47.680 --> 03:50.700
You punk, do you know who I am?

03:50.810 --> 03:52.780
I'm with the Kakita Clan, moron!

03:52.950 --> 03:54.420
Kakita Clan?

03:54.780 --> 03:57.950
So friggin' what?
This should strike some fear in you...

03:58.090 --> 03:59.420
We're with the Ooedo Clan!

03:59.560 --> 04:01.580
Ooedo Clan?

04:01.920 --> 04:03.420
You heard me!

04:07.630 --> 04:09.620
Hey, cheers!

04:09.730 --> 04:11.170
Cheers!

04:14.640 --> 04:17.270
Yo, Minoru. Cheers!

04:17.370 --> 04:19.070
Cheer...

04:27.780 --> 04:28.770
Good morning.

04:28.880 --> 04:29.580
Yo.

04:29.650 --> 04:30.410
Good morning.

04:30.520 --> 04:31.040
Yo.

04:31.420 --> 04:32.080
Good morning.

04:32.190 --> 04:32.950
Morning!

04:34.590 --> 04:35.250
Hey.

04:35.920 --> 04:37.420
Oh, good morning.

04:37.530 --> 04:39.650
You remember Kudoh, right?

04:39.900 --> 04:40.660
Huh?

04:41.930 --> 04:44.060
What are you talking about?

04:44.430 --> 04:49.300
I've heard that he's been hanging
with a gang called the Nekomata Group.

04:49.710 --> 04:50.430
What?

04:50.540 --> 04:54.370
Well, he probably doesn't give a damn
about this school anymore, but...

04:54.510 --> 04:57.240
...you'd better be careful,
he might try to get revenge.

04:57.410 --> 04:59.280
The Nekomata Group?

04:59.520 --> 05:01.310
I've never heard of it.

05:15.800 --> 05:18.200
My head hurts...

05:18.330 --> 05:21.600
How the hell did we get back
here last night?

05:22.540 --> 05:23.200
Huh?

05:24.840 --> 05:26.710
Hope I'm not intruding.

05:27.040 --> 05:28.480
Who the hell are you?

05:29.010 --> 05:30.980
Calm down. I'm...

05:35.480 --> 05:37.040
What the hell are you doing?

05:38.150 --> 05:40.650
Wait!
Don't jump the gun! I'm...

05:40.820 --> 05:42.760
Hey, what's all the commotion?

05:43.130 --> 05:45.890
Oh, it's you, Uncle Tenkai!

05:45.990 --> 05:47.830
Oh, Kumi-chan!

05:48.460 --> 05:49.950
Isn't Tenkai...

05:50.300 --> 05:54.960
...the man who took a pledge
of brotherhood with Kumicho?

05:56.540 --> 05:57.230
What?

05:57.340 --> 05:59.870
They say we're violating
the Kakita Clan's turf?

05:59.980 --> 06:02.070
Not the ruthless Kakita Clan!

06:02.210 --> 06:04.940
The Tanukibara Group's No. 2 outfit!

06:05.350 --> 06:09.340
It started with a series of skirmishes
between the rank-and-filers, but...

06:09.480 --> 06:11.720
...there just doesn't
seem to be an end to it.

06:11.820 --> 06:14.350
The Kakita Clan is very militant.

06:14.490 --> 06:17.720
Now they're clamoring for war
with the Ooedo Clan!

06:17.830 --> 06:18.620
I don't believe it!

06:18.730 --> 06:20.030
Wait a minute.

06:20.230 --> 06:24.000
We don't allow disputes of
any kind with other clans.

06:24.100 --> 06:25.470
It can't be us!

06:25.800 --> 06:26.670
Still...

06:26.770 --> 06:29.970
It seems that whoever's messing with
the Kakitas is using the Ooedo name.

06:30.140 --> 06:30.870
What?

06:31.140 --> 06:33.200
And then yesterday...

06:33.880 --> 06:35.710
...this was found.

06:36.610 --> 06:39.210
But that's our badge!

06:40.120 --> 06:41.210
Excuse me.

06:42.820 --> 06:43.580
Huh?

06:43.850 --> 06:45.050
That's my...

06:45.320 --> 06:46.150
What?

06:47.920 --> 06:50.830
Did you have a run-in
with the Kakita Clan?

06:50.930 --> 06:52.020
Hell no!

06:52.130 --> 06:54.120
Then why did they find your badge there?

06:54.230 --> 06:55.200
Answer me!

06:55.300 --> 06:59.430
I got plastered yesterday.
I figured I'd lost it somewhere.

06:59.530 --> 07:01.300
Lost it, huh?

07:01.400 --> 07:05.070
I'm telling the truth.
We never fought with the Kakita Clan!

07:05.170 --> 07:06.940
You gotta believe us!

07:07.680 --> 07:11.440
Uncle, these guys are idiots
but they don't lie.

07:11.650 --> 07:14.740
I think someone's setting us up.

07:14.880 --> 07:16.250
Ojou.

07:16.850 --> 07:19.520
Actually, I agree with you, but...

07:19.720 --> 07:22.320
...Kakita's in no mood to hear that.

07:22.460 --> 07:24.050
That's why I thought...

07:24.190 --> 07:26.860
...the best thing to do would
be for Kuroda to step in...

07:26.960 --> 07:30.130
The thing is, the Kumicho
is in the hospital.

07:30.430 --> 07:32.770
Oh? How bad is it?

07:33.270 --> 07:36.670
It's nothing severe,
but he needs to stay in bed.

07:36.770 --> 07:38.500
Well, that's very unfortunate...

07:38.940 --> 07:41.040
Actually, there's going
to be a meeting with...

07:41.140 --> 07:43.140
...the Kakita Clan to
discuss this incident.

07:43.280 --> 07:45.510
Chairman Tanukibara
will be there as well.

07:45.650 --> 07:47.550
You mean the Don of Kantou...

07:47.920 --> 07:49.510
Tanukibara...

07:50.150 --> 07:53.850
I thought that if Kuroda
made an appearance...

07:54.020 --> 07:57.750
...the Chairman would
straighten everything out...

07:57.960 --> 07:58.830
Uncle.

07:59.030 --> 08:00.020
I'll go.

08:00.160 --> 08:01.060
What?

08:01.330 --> 08:02.890
Is there a problem?

08:03.030 --> 08:05.160
Well, no...

08:06.400 --> 08:09.060
Ojou is our Acting Kumicho.

08:09.200 --> 08:12.730
But she has far less pull
than my blood-brother Kuroda.

08:12.840 --> 08:18.870
Well, I guess if you show up with those
two, they might be willing to listen.

08:20.580 --> 08:23.680
The Ooedo Clan has made
a significant concession.

08:23.820 --> 08:27.620
Blood has been spilled, but now
is time for you to reconcile.

08:28.160 --> 08:30.820
Now, then, clap your hands.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.490
That's going way too far!

08:37.600 --> 08:39.760
These are trumped-up charges, anyway!

08:39.940 --> 08:41.060
Wakamatsu!

08:41.200 --> 08:44.330
Don't talk like a katagi, whining that
you did or didn't do something!

08:44.410 --> 08:45.400
But...

08:45.940 --> 08:49.430
If someone wants to start a war, you can
be damned sure he'll find some reason!

08:49.540 --> 08:51.670
But we have to reach
reconciliation now.

08:51.780 --> 08:53.680
Otherwise, there'll be
be needless bloodshed.

08:53.780 --> 08:55.750
Well, he's right.

08:57.690 --> 08:58.750
I understand.

08:58.990 --> 09:00.510
I'll take them.

09:00.890 --> 09:02.620
Tetsu! Minoru! Got it?

09:02.860 --> 09:03.920
Yes.

09:05.090 --> 09:06.250
Ojou...

09:10.270 --> 09:11.290
Ojou.

09:11.430 --> 09:13.370
I better go get ready.

09:17.640 --> 09:19.730
You're doing this for the Clan.

09:19.940 --> 09:23.380
We can't have these confrontations
in the Kumicho's absence.

09:23.510 --> 09:26.970
Oh, come on. You might get lucky
and only lose a finger or two.

09:27.080 --> 09:29.140
Don't stress over it.

09:29.280 --> 09:32.520
<i>Hair Salon LAMARTINE</i>

09:33.190 --> 09:34.620
Not good.

09:35.290 --> 09:37.020
Where's Ojou?

09:37.230 --> 09:40.590
We need to get going soon,
or we'll be late.

09:41.800 --> 09:42.770
I'm back.

09:43.170 --> 09:44.460
Sorry to make you wait...

09:48.440 --> 09:49.300
Ojou!

09:49.400 --> 09:50.900
How cool!

09:51.140 --> 09:52.840
Vengeance is mine!

09:52.970 --> 09:55.530
Awesome! Awesome!

09:55.710 --> 09:57.080
One more time!

09:57.180 --> 09:58.340
Vengeance is mine!

09:58.450 --> 10:00.080
That's so cool! That's so cool!

10:00.180 --> 10:01.810
One more time! One more time!

10:01.980 --> 10:03.820
Vengeance is mine!

10:12.130 --> 10:15.360
So we're going to leave
them here after all, Ojou?

10:15.460 --> 10:19.160
This dispute is bullshit.
We're not handing them over!

10:20.000 --> 10:21.090
Ojou...

10:23.940 --> 10:26.100
All right, it's their move now.

10:26.270 --> 10:27.300
Come on.

10:42.420 --> 10:43.550
Ojou.

10:43.930 --> 10:45.360
Solar plexus!

10:45.660 --> 10:47.390
Solar plexus!

10:47.530 --> 10:49.520
You were such a little girl.

10:49.660 --> 10:53.100
When did you get to be
such a fine gangster?

10:56.170 --> 10:59.140
Kyo, this is Kumiko.

10:59.410 --> 11:03.440
I'm taking her in, so I want you
to look after her from now on.

11:03.750 --> 11:04.840
Yes, sir!

11:06.620 --> 11:07.580
Ojou.

11:07.780 --> 11:08.770
What's the matter?

11:09.020 --> 11:12.780
Kyo-san, what's a "Yakuza?"
Are the Yakuza bad?

11:13.290 --> 11:14.280
Ojou!

11:14.860 --> 11:17.490
Did someone bully you?

11:17.590 --> 11:20.620
Tell me the snotnose's name!
I'll beat him to death!

11:21.100 --> 11:22.790
No! I'll do it myself.

11:24.070 --> 11:27.230
I'm going to straighten this out,
so teach me how to fight!

11:29.770 --> 11:31.100
That's no good!

11:31.240 --> 11:34.800
Dodge the pingpong balls first,
then you can throw punches.

11:34.910 --> 11:38.400
Aim for the chest,
the solar plexus, and the nuts!

11:40.850 --> 11:42.370
Solar plexus! Solar plexus!

11:42.950 --> 11:44.610
Solar plexus! Solar plexus!

11:45.250 --> 11:46.950
That kinda tickles!

11:47.060 --> 11:49.120
You're not hitting my solar plexus!

11:53.460 --> 11:54.590
Bull's-eye.

11:55.300 --> 11:58.270
That's where my solar plexus is.

11:58.970 --> 11:59.730
Kyo-san.

12:00.240 --> 12:02.640
Kyo-san!
Kyo-san!

12:07.910 --> 12:11.510
Ojou has a lot of compassion.

12:14.120 --> 12:17.750
You guys owe her a lot.

12:21.060 --> 12:22.820
Sitting here like this...

12:23.020 --> 12:27.860
...reminds me of when
we first came here.

12:27.960 --> 12:28.950
Yeah.

12:31.470 --> 12:33.460
You want to join our clan?

12:33.970 --> 12:35.300
Are you kidding me?

12:35.500 --> 12:37.200
You two are still in junior high!

12:37.370 --> 12:40.100
Shut up! We're not talking to you!

12:40.280 --> 12:41.400
What the hell did you say?

12:41.510 --> 12:43.270
Who do you think you're talking to?

12:43.380 --> 12:46.370
They've been making
mischief on our turf, so...

12:46.480 --> 12:48.540
...I gave them a little shakedown.

12:48.650 --> 12:51.140
But now they've come
skulking back of their own accord.

12:51.250 --> 12:52.810
Who are they trying to kid?

12:52.920 --> 12:54.050
Go home!

12:54.320 --> 12:56.150
Your parents are wondering
where you are.

12:56.260 --> 12:57.750
We don't have any parents.

12:57.860 --> 12:59.120
Don't lie to me.

12:59.230 --> 13:00.220
It's true!

13:00.360 --> 13:03.820
Mine left me with a relative
when I was a baby, then took off!

13:03.930 --> 13:04.700
Huh?

13:05.130 --> 13:06.360
Me too.

13:07.570 --> 13:10.800
I'd always lived alone with my mom...

13:11.340 --> 13:14.400
But last week when I got home,
she'd taken everything.

13:14.540 --> 13:17.140
She ran off with some guy.

13:17.280 --> 13:19.840
She abandoned me. I'm...

13:24.320 --> 13:25.810
Stop crying!

13:26.350 --> 13:28.820
You both look like you'd kill a cow.

13:37.130 --> 13:38.190
Wakamatsu?

13:38.300 --> 13:39.000
Yes?

13:39.900 --> 13:43.930
Since their parents don't want them,
do you think I can take them in?

13:44.040 --> 13:44.800
Huh?

13:45.010 --> 13:48.410
See, I've always wanted
a cute little brother.

13:48.510 --> 13:51.310
Cute? You think they're cute?

13:52.480 --> 13:53.280
Well...

13:53.380 --> 13:54.350
...in a way.

13:54.450 --> 13:56.540
Cute? Them?

13:56.750 --> 13:59.920
I'll bet you're the only one
in the world who'd say that.

14:00.020 --> 14:01.150
No question.

14:01.260 --> 14:03.560
I think I'll ask Grandpa!

14:04.230 --> 14:05.160
Ready?

14:05.260 --> 14:06.190
Okay!

14:10.070 --> 14:11.060
Huh?

14:11.200 --> 14:13.460
You're not even trying, are you?

14:13.800 --> 14:15.900
Sorry! Sorry!

14:16.200 --> 14:19.610
Ojou! I need to send
the boys to the store...

14:19.710 --> 14:20.900
We're going!

14:21.410 --> 14:23.470
Tetsu! Minoru!
Let's go see a movie.

14:33.560 --> 14:35.920
What the hell were you two doing?

14:39.160 --> 14:39.860
Idiot!

14:40.030 --> 14:40.690
Moron!

14:40.800 --> 14:41.460
Fat ass!

14:41.560 --> 14:43.930
Snotnose! Snotnose! Snotnose!

14:45.100 --> 14:48.730
If you have time for that, why don't
you get your asses to school? School!

14:48.870 --> 14:52.070
Minoru, Tetsu, I catch you again,
you're both dead!

14:53.880 --> 14:57.110
Listen, you're still under
compulsory education.

14:57.210 --> 14:59.940
If you make any trouble at school,
it won't be good for the Clan.

15:01.720 --> 15:02.710
Minoru!

15:03.920 --> 15:07.360
Look, if someone tries to bait you,
don't stoop to his level.

15:07.460 --> 15:10.080
Think of it as part of your training.
Take it like a man.

15:10.360 --> 15:11.620
Hey, look at that kid....

15:11.730 --> 15:12.320
Huh.

15:12.430 --> 15:14.160
Come straight home after school.

15:14.260 --> 15:15.290
I'll be waiting.

15:16.360 --> 15:17.230
Okay.

15:17.470 --> 15:18.800
What?

15:18.900 --> 15:21.130
The teacher said that
he'll let me graduate, but...

15:21.240 --> 15:23.330
...not to show my face at
school until graduation day.

15:23.510 --> 15:26.740
He said I'd only contaminate
the air in the classroom.

15:26.980 --> 15:29.950
That goddamn asshole teacher!
I'll kill him!

15:31.380 --> 15:32.940
Fair enough.

15:33.050 --> 15:35.310
If he told you not to come
until graduation day...

15:35.450 --> 15:37.720
...then we'll go see him
after the ceremony...

15:38.850 --> 15:40.650
...to pay our "respects!"

15:41.960 --> 15:43.150
Who are you?

15:43.690 --> 15:47.130
Thank you for looking after my
brother for the last three years.

15:47.230 --> 15:48.320
Brother?

15:48.460 --> 15:51.020
Oh, and what's your brother's name?

15:51.700 --> 15:53.730
It's Minoru Tatsukawa.

15:53.840 --> 15:55.100
W-What?

15:55.240 --> 16:00.330
You're a disgrace to
the teaching profession!

16:04.410 --> 16:05.440
Ojou.

16:07.050 --> 16:10.310
Ojou!

16:15.820 --> 16:17.790
Damn, missed again.

16:18.090 --> 16:20.080
Kuma, cut it out, for God's sake.

16:20.200 --> 16:23.130
Yeah, I mean, do you know
where we are?

16:23.300 --> 16:26.130
Right next door to the
Kakita Clan's office.

16:26.270 --> 16:27.760
You could get yourself killed!

16:28.170 --> 16:29.360
Hey, right.

16:29.740 --> 16:30.900
Let's go.

16:38.650 --> 16:40.440
Acting Kumicho, we have arrived.

16:43.450 --> 16:44.250
Whoa!

16:47.520 --> 16:48.850
Shall we go?

17:03.100 --> 17:05.160
Wow, a female gangster.

17:05.310 --> 17:06.970
I've never seen one before.

17:12.350 --> 17:17.410
So the Ooedo Clan will be handing over
the two youngsters, is that right?

17:17.990 --> 17:21.390
Normally, we'd conduct a thorough
investigation into the matter...

17:21.520 --> 17:24.150
...but I didn't think
we should try your patience.

17:24.260 --> 17:25.250
Damn right!

17:25.490 --> 17:27.430
We've got casualties, for chrissake!

17:27.530 --> 17:30.690
Precisely why we're here to ask
the Chairman's help in bringing...

17:30.800 --> 17:33.290
...about a reconciliation.

17:33.840 --> 17:34.930
Excuse me.

17:35.700 --> 17:38.330
The Ooedo Group's
Acting Kumicho has arrived.

17:38.510 --> 17:39.740
Send them in.

17:45.980 --> 17:47.780
Please excuse me.

17:50.350 --> 17:52.290
Kumi-chan!

17:52.490 --> 17:54.460
Allow me to introduce myself.

17:54.760 --> 17:58.320
I am the third generation
Acting Kumicho of the Ooedo Clan.

17:58.430 --> 18:00.120
My name is Kumiko.

18:00.260 --> 18:02.630
I'm honored to make your acquaintance.

18:02.760 --> 18:04.490
Enough with the pleasantries!

18:04.630 --> 18:06.970
Are those the two young punks?

18:07.170 --> 18:09.030
They don't look young to me!

18:09.440 --> 18:10.770
I didn't bring them with me.

18:11.010 --> 18:11.500
What?

18:11.710 --> 18:13.230
Kumi-chan!

18:13.710 --> 18:15.230
They're outside, right?

18:15.480 --> 18:17.670
You've got them right outside, right?

18:17.980 --> 18:19.850
No, they're back at home.

18:20.050 --> 18:20.950
Christ!

18:21.080 --> 18:22.910
Then what did you come here for?

18:23.380 --> 18:24.350
Reconciliation.

18:24.650 --> 18:26.050
Don't screw with me!

18:26.190 --> 18:26.980
Hold it.

18:27.260 --> 18:28.050
Chairman?

18:29.890 --> 18:31.830
Kumiko...

18:31.960 --> 18:35.090
If Ryu had come,
it would make more sense.

18:35.200 --> 18:39.220
But you're here as Acting Kumicho,
asking for reconciliation?

18:39.330 --> 18:39.860
Yes.

18:40.070 --> 18:42.370
Who the hell do you
think you're kidding!

18:42.570 --> 18:43.470
Kakita!

18:43.640 --> 18:45.110
You shut the hell up.

18:49.440 --> 18:52.610
So Kumiko...

18:53.210 --> 18:58.480
...did you consider the possibility that
you might be facing a bloodbath here?

18:59.490 --> 19:02.320
If that happens, I'll take care of it.

19:21.640 --> 19:24.840
Just what I expected from the
granddaughter of the Rising Dragon.

19:24.950 --> 19:26.850
You've certainly got guts.

19:26.950 --> 19:28.180
Very amusing!

19:29.380 --> 19:33.450
Oh, I have no intention of
allowing needless bloodshed.

19:33.590 --> 19:35.960
I came here to
broker a reconciliation.

19:36.090 --> 19:37.180
Chairman!

19:37.330 --> 19:38.620
But, Chairman!

19:38.830 --> 19:40.590
Shut the hell up!

19:40.860 --> 19:44.390
You need to stop walking around
with that chip on your shoulder.

19:44.500 --> 19:46.470
You're way behind the times!

19:46.570 --> 19:47.830
R-Right...

19:50.740 --> 19:51.930
Chairman!

19:56.980 --> 19:59.380
Thank you very much.

20:00.980 --> 20:03.510
Ojou, you blew us all away.

20:03.950 --> 20:06.440
The Kumicho would have been so proud...

20:06.920 --> 20:09.020
And you look really good in that outfit!

20:09.120 --> 20:09.920
Really?

20:11.790 --> 20:15.230
Ojou, I just heard from
one of my underlings...

20:15.360 --> 20:21.000
It might be some punks hired by the
Nekomata Group who used our name.

20:21.200 --> 20:22.860
Nekomata Group?

20:23.640 --> 20:25.370
I've heard that name somewhere.

20:25.710 --> 20:30.610
I've heard that he's been hanging
with a gang called the Nekomata Group.

20:30.880 --> 20:31.810
I see.

20:32.180 --> 20:34.620
They sound like a bunch
of good-for-nothings.

20:34.750 --> 20:37.410
I'm going to keep an eye out
for them from now on.

20:37.520 --> 20:38.210
Right.

20:38.720 --> 20:39.650
Ojou!

20:40.350 --> 20:41.480
Ojou!

20:41.620 --> 20:42.990
Are you all right, Ojou?

20:43.090 --> 20:44.420
Are you hurt?

20:44.530 --> 20:45.650
Are you all right?

20:45.760 --> 20:47.730
You assholes, you look like hell!

20:47.930 --> 20:50.490
But we really wanted to go after Ojou!

20:50.600 --> 20:53.230
And Fuji kept getting in our way, see...

20:54.570 --> 20:57.230
I don't believe those two!

20:57.670 --> 20:58.770
Ojou!

20:58.870 --> 21:00.600
If we hadn't messed up...

21:00.740 --> 21:02.970
We're so sorry!

21:03.480 --> 21:05.670
Idiots, stop that blubbering.

21:05.880 --> 21:08.250
You both look like you could kill a cow!

21:12.720 --> 21:14.090
Consigliere.

21:15.320 --> 21:16.260
Kumiko!

21:16.490 --> 21:17.820
Consigliere!

21:17.990 --> 21:19.150
Aren't you glad?

21:19.290 --> 21:21.690
He came over 'cause
he was worried about you!

21:22.960 --> 21:25.090
Is Kumiko all right?

21:25.200 --> 21:27.400
Yes, she's fine.

21:27.570 --> 21:29.040
Where is she now?

21:33.740 --> 21:35.300
Kumiko?

21:42.420 --> 21:45.750
For god's sake, you have
way too much makeup on!

21:47.290 --> 21:49.550
Consigliere, don't you think
you're being harsh?

21:49.660 --> 21:51.520
Please, Consigliere.

21:51.760 --> 21:52.990
Sorry, sorry.

22:07.280 --> 22:17.270
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:18.350 --> 22:28.250
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:29.060 --> 22:39.000
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:39.170 --> 22:49.170
<i>On those days when I am alone and cold</i>
<i>I'll light a fire with my own two hands.</i>

22:49.720 --> 22:59.720
<i>Treacherous mountains are my chosen path.</i>
<i>I'll move forward without a backward glance.</i>

23:18.380 --> 23:21.750
Consigliere, I can't
believe you said that!

23:21.850 --> 23:25.550
Piercing Ojou's pure
little heart like that...

23:25.950 --> 23:29.220
Really, how could you
be so cruel to her?

23:29.360 --> 23:30.760
On top of that...

23:30.860 --> 23:35.320
I've heard rumors that Ojou's
teaching career might be in jeopardy!

23:35.460 --> 23:37.930
Watch me go the extra mile for her!

23:38.200 --> 23:40.930
Next episode:
Kyo-san's Knockout Performance

23:41.070 --> 23:43.560
What a great actor!

23:43.740 --> 23:45.740
<i>Kyo-san's Knockout Performance</i>

23:45.740 --> 23:51.540
<i>To be continued...</i>
